2. **KeenSlider Initialization & Slide Count Bug:** KeenSlider initializes on mount. If it initializes on the **4 skeleton items**, it configures the internal carousel looping mechanism for 4 items. When the API response arrives and React renders the **6 real items**, the loop cloning breaks. 

